      "writtenOn": "2025-12-12T03:36:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually I think we shouldn\u0027t use mm-\u003eowner at the first place\n\nLook at the caller, at line 2117\n\n`trace_android_vh_process_madvise_begin(task, behavior)` tracepoint \"begin\"s with `task`, and `trace_android_vh_process_madvise_iter` should use the same task structure of what `trace_android_vh_process_madvise_begin` uses. That is why I fix this with passing task down to this function to ensure they are using the same object.",
      "parentUuid": "b9e168da_e3d2749f",
      "revId": "35603a4d0b612a2eb5fcbbd39642b6e3cbef32d1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
