        "id": 1869395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-12T03:45:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that would be fine if you didn\u0027t need to change the signature of vector_madvise(). However, I would also rather see the tracepoint call behind CONFIG_MEMCG as it could make maintenance easier.",
      "parentUuid": "dff391c5_fa380a2d",
      "revId": "35603a4d0b612a2eb5fcbbd39642b6e3cbef32d1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
