      "message": "Since mm_struct is already part of the KMI, let\u0027s change the signature to take mm as the first argument. No need to guard with CONFIG_MEMCG then.\n```\ntrace_android_vh_process_madvise_iter(mm, behavior, \u0026ret);\n```",
